      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BULA (3) ran good time (19.25) winning a Grade 5 three back at this track but missed the frame latest finishing fourth at this track. Expecting sharp improvement. IRINKA BRETT (7) has been a little hard to follow, finishing out of the placings latest but was in winning form two back scoring in a Grade 5 at Wentworth Park. Key player on best and worth another try. NOT PERFECT (6) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 1.2 lengths at this track in a handy 19.65. Jumping from the pinch draw but goes well over this trip. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. HIJACK (8) cannot be left out after placing here at this trip last start.",
